_url":"https://github.com/darthShadow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darthShadow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/558040915","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/3763#issuecomment-558040915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/3763","id":558040915,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1ODA0MDkxNQ==","user":{"login":"88lex","id":36984295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTg0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36984295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex","html_url":"https://github.com/88lex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-25T08:13:35Z","updated_at":"2019-11-25T13:00:15Z","body":"Further to the above:\r\n\r\nThis can be extraordinarily dangerous. EDIT: Missing error code/odd behavior only occurs when you try to sync/copy/lsd/etc from the root of a remote e.g. `source:`. When copying from any subfolder you will get the correct error ( error message plus exit code = 3).\r\n****************\r\n`rclone size/lsd/etc` does not show an error. Which is inconvenient.\r\n\r\nBut if you run `rclone sync` with a service file that exists but does not have sharing/permission on the source Shared Drive then it deletes all the files in the destination.\r\n\r\n`rclone sync source: destination:`  <= works perfectly.\r\n\r\n`rclone sync source: destination: --drive-service-account-file=1.json` <= works perfectly when 1.json exists and source and destination both have shared files with the email for 1.json.\r\n\r\n`rclone sync source: destination: --drive-service-account-file=2.json` <= DELETES all the files in destination when 2.json exists and has permissions in destination but does not have permissions in source.\r\n\r\nTested with current rclone win/linux/mac and observed the same behavior.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/558040915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"88lex","id":36984295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTg0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36984295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex","html_url":"https://github.com/88lex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88lex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/88